From 930d2297d6dfe528ead377a00a31a0b727dd5aaf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:28:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat: UPI collect links, one-tap settle-up,
 amount-in-words, daily dues sweep, popup/copy fallbacks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New ideas included:
- UPI collect links: optional shop UPI ID in Settings; reminders and
  statements now append a one-tap 'upi://pay' intent link (pa/pn/am/cu/tn),
  plus a 'Pay via UPI' button in the customer sheet that opens the
  customer's own UPI app — honest alternative to WhatsApp Business API
- One-tap 'Settle full balance' in the customer sheet (confirm dialog,
  records a regular PAYMENT line with force:true, balance -> Rs 0)
- Amount in words on reminders/statements ('Rupees Two Hundred Only',
  Indian lakh/crore system) — standard trust-building receipt format
- Backup freshness nudge in Settings (localStorage-stamped, warns after
  7 days, stamps on download)
- PWA 'Install app' button via beforeinstallprompt
- '/' keyboard shortcut focuses the entry box

Failed tasks retried a different way:
- git push failed (sandbox has no GitHub credentials) -> repo packaged as
  a git bundle + format-patch files under download/ with push instructions
- server-side cron reminders impossible -> 'morning dues sweep' runs once
  per IST day on first app open (localStorage-guarded /api/reminders/run),
  silent on failure, never creates/edits financial data
- window.open with noopener always returns null (popup-block detection
  impossible) -> openWhatsApp() opener-severing helper with
  copy-to-clipboard fallback so reminder text is never silently lost

Verified: settings upiId validation (400 on bad VPA, null clears),
reminder+statement messages contain words line and UPI link, settle E2E
(Rs 123.45 -> PAYMENT 12345 paise -> balance 0), browser E2E (sheet
buttons desktop+390px mobile, settle+reverse roundtrip, backup nudge
stamp, '/' focus, footer gap 0, zero console errors), eslint clean
